 JAX-RS classes are excluded via `@IfBuildProfile` (#15215), it is still visible in the generated openapi document.\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\nWhen a JAX-RS class is excluded from the current build via an `IfBuildProperty` annotation (or similar), it should also be excluded from openapi document generation.\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\nThe endpoints of the JAX-RS class are visible in openapi and swagger, but can not be called.\r\n\r\n## To Reproduce\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Create a JAX-RS class\r\n2. include `quarkus-smallrye-openapi` extension\r\n3. add `@IfBuildProfile(\"foo\")` to the class\r\n4. run in dev mode\r\n5. open swagger ui\r\n6. see that the JAX-RS class is visible\r\n\r\n## Environment (please complete the following information):\r\n\r\n### Quarkus version or git rev\r\n`1.13.0.Final`\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"phillip-kruger","id":6836179,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MzYxNzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6836179?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phillip-kruger","html_url":"https://github.com/phillip-kruger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phillip-kruger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phillip-kruger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phillip-kruger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phillip-kruger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phillip-kruger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phillip-kruger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phillip-kruger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phillip-kruger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phillip-kruger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/16218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hoor